Reminder#goal_reminder

Hello <%= @user.name %>,

This is a friendly reminder about your goals:

<% @goals.each do |goal| %>
Title: <%= goal.title %>
<%# Due Date: <%= goal.due_date.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %>
Current Status: <%= goal.status %>

<% end %>
Don't forget to update your progress!

Best regards,
Your Todo App